## 2. Hardened Data Gate
- Agents read only from the static local filesystem: /mesh/drops/ and /mesh/crystal_matrix/.
- Fail-closed: if DATABASE_URL does not resolve to 127.0.0.1 or localhost,
  the service terminates with HTTP 503.

